# Microsoft Advertising (Monetize Now / pubCenter)
# Get your ad unit IDs from https://monetizenow.microsoft.com or Microsoft pubCenter
# Add the ad code snippets to public/index.html
#
# Use a single ad unit for all slots:
# REACT_APP_MS_ADS_ELEMENT_ID=your-div-id-from-microsoft
#
# Or use different ad units per slot:
# REACT_APP_MS_ADS_WELCOME_ID=welcome-banner-id
# REACT_APP_MS_ADS_VIEWER_ID=viewer-banner-id
